sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Desktop UI
    participant AI as AI backend
    participant PP as Permission policy
    participant OP as Bounded operation
    participant AU as Audit record

    U->>UI: Ask the assistant to do something
    UI->>AI: Send request
    AI->>AI: Decide which tool, if any, is needed
    AI->>PP: Is this tool call allowed?
    alt allowed
        PP-->>AI: Allow
        AI->>OP: Run with limits (time, scope)
        OP-->>AI: Result or bounded failure
        AI->>AU: Record the operation
        AI-->>UI: Answer with result
    else denied
        PP-->>AI: Deny
        AI->>AU: Record the denial
        AI-->>UI: Explain that it was not permitted
    end
    UI-->>U: Show response
    Note over PP,AU: Conceptual flow of the reported design.<br/>Exact interfaces are not published here.
